  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Pacific Islands Customs and Trade (IMPACT - UNCTAD) 
PRISE - Output 1.1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of IMPACT is to boost and increase intra-regional and international trade.IMPACTs specific objective (purpose) is to improve trade facilitation and border/customs procedures. To achieve the objectives, IMPACT will deliver the following Results (Outcomes):Result 1:Improved PACP country ability to benefit from WTO priority measures;Result 2:Harmonised Customs operations across all Pacific ACP;Result 3.National Single Window systems requirements defined and guidelines prepared;Result 4.Strengthened technical understanding, leadership and statistical capacity;</narrative>
  </description>
